'''Bednom''' is an [[NPC]] in the {{Zone|Dwarven Village}} who tells his strange dreams to the player.

== Mechanics ==
'''Bednom''' gains new dialogue upon talking to him on 3 separate [[SkyBlock Time|SkyBlock Days]].

On the third and final day of talking to the NPC, '''Bednom''' will say that there is a treasure buried in loose rocks next to a bridge. The player must then go to {{Coordinates|-12|127|57}} and mine the gravel block there. The bridge that Bednom talks about is the Divan's Gateway, which connects the Cliffside Veins with the Great Ice Wall, and the treasure location is the gravel near [[Bylma]], the NPC by the bridge.  A chest will appear, containing the following loot:
*{{Item|Mithril Powder|amount=500}}
*{{Item|Enchanted Titanium|amount=3}}
*{{Item|Enchanted Gold Ingot|amount=7}}
*{{Item|Enchanted Diamond|amount=3}}
*{{Item|Enchanted Mithril|amount=10}}
Completing '''Bednom'''{{'}}s quest will award the player with the {{ach|Nightmare|ach=true}}.

== Nightmare Nullifier ==
The {{Item|Nightmare Nullifier}} is obtained by giving '''Bednom''' {{Item|Black Coffee|amount=1}} and waiting 1 [[Time_Systems#SkyBlock_Time|SkyBlock Day]]. '''Bednom'''{{'}}s quest must be completed first.

